{
  "schema": "hima-team-definition/1",
  "title": "产品研究与功能规格",
  "members": [
    {
      "id": "lead",
      "role": "产品负责人 / 决策与交付",
      "runtime": "pi",
      "modelRef": "default",
      "skills": [
        "hima-team-spec"
      ],
      "instructions": "固定目标、受众、材料和验收；安排真实研究、反证和编辑委派，等待核验交接；记录业务决定、未决与否决。 使用已安装的 hima-team-spec 方法；Host 动作用 Hima MCP member_context 提交 action/request（Pi 中是 mcp__hima__member_context）。只消费 Host 材料、记忆和交接，不用 shell 查找工具或读取 control/native/journal/config。最终只回复一个 TaskToolOutput JSON 对象，不加说明或 Markdown 代码围栏。",
      "toolRefs": [
        "hima-member-context"
      ],
      "knowledgeRefs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "researcher",
      "role": "研究 / 来源与假设",
      "runtime": "opencode",
      "modelRef": "default",
      "skills": [
        "hima-team-spec"
      ],
      "instructions": "独立读取获准原件，逐项核对事实、假设、冲突和来源 locator；交付可核查研究，不代替人批准产品承诺。 使用已安装的 hima-team-spec 方法；Host 动作用 Hima MCP member_context 提交 action/request（Pi 中是 mcp__hima__member_context）。只消费 Host 材料、记忆和交接，不用 shell 查找工具或读取 control/native/journal/config。最终只回复一个 TaskToolOutput JSON 对象，不加说明或 Markdown 代码围栏。",
      "toolRefs": [
        "hima-member-context"
      ],
      "knowledgeRefs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "challenger",
      "role": "反证 / 可行性与边界",
      "runtime": "pi",
      "modelRef": "default",
      "skills": [
        "hima-team-spec"
      ],
      "instructions": "独立检验提案，提出最小反例、缺证据和否决理由；区分未知与负结果。 使用已安装的 hima-team-spec 方法；Host 动作用 Hima MCP member_context 提交 action/request（Pi 中是 mcp__hima__member_context）。只消费 Host 材料、记忆和交接，不用 shell 查找工具或读取 control/native/journal/config。最终只回复一个 TaskToolOutput JSON 对象，不加说明或 Markdown 代码围栏。",
      "toolRefs": [
        "hima-member-context"
      ],
      "knowledgeRefs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "editor",
      "role": "编辑 / 研发可用性",
      "runtime": "opencode",
      "modelRef": "default",
      "skills": [
        "hima-team-spec"
      ],
      "instructions": "用正常和异常情景走读规格，核对功能价值、用户行为、输入输出、接口、非目标和验收；退回歧义。 使用已安装的 hima-team-spec 方法；Host 动作用 Hima MCP member_context 提交 action/request（Pi 中是 mcp__hima__member_context）。只消费 Host 材料、记忆和交接，不用 shell 查找工具或读取 control/native/journal/config。最终只回复一个 TaskToolOutput JSON 对象，不加说明或 Markdown 代码围栏。",
      "toolRefs": [
        "hima-member-context"
      ],
      "knowledgeRefs": []
    }
  ],
  "leaderMemberId": "lead",
  "collaboration": "负责人明确分工，研究和反证先独立调查，再通过带来源的交接复核；编辑检查研发可用性。负责人在授权范围决定条件采用或否决，业务范围、权限与预算变化交人。Host/DBOS 执行并核验接续，普通讨论不唤醒全员。",
  "delivery": {
    "description": "可指导研发的功能规格、来源、事实与假设、冲突处置、反证、验收与残余；负结果或待决定可以诚实交付。",
    "output": {
      "version": "hima-functional-spec/1",
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "goal": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "audience": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "decision": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "proceed",
              "conditional",
              "reject",
              "insufficient-evidence"
            ]
          },
          "functionalSpec": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "userBehavior": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "inputsOutputs": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "interfaces": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "exceptions": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "nonGoals": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "value",
              "userBehavior",
              "inputsOutputs",
              "interfaces",
              "exceptions",
              "nonGoals"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "sources": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "stageId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "materialId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "sha256": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
                },
                "version": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "location": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "supports": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "stageId",
                "materialId",
                "sha256",
                "version",
                "location",
                "supports"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "conflicts": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          },
          "assumptions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          },
          "openQuestions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          },
          "acceptance": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "scenario": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "expected": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "sourceRefs": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "id",
                "scenario",
                "expected",
                "sourceRefs"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "minItems": 1
          },
          "memoryRefs": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "memoryId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "version": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                "eventId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "revision": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "memoryId",
                "version",
                "eventId",
                "revision"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "remaining": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          },
          "facts": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "claim": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "sourceRefs": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "minItems": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "claim",
                "sourceRefs"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "goal",
          "audience",
          "decision",
          "functionalSpec",
          "sources",
          "conflicts",
          "assumptions",
          "openQuestions",
          "acceptance",
          "memoryRefs",
          "remaining",
          "facts"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  }
}
